{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What wish is worth dying for? What wish is worth killing your fellow man?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Inverted Tower is a dark fantasy CRPG with multiple routes and endings, all surrounding the hunt for a wish-granting chalice guarded beneath a dungeon known as the INVERTED TOWER. This dungeon is ruthless, containing an entirely new environment on each floor, growing in its's cruelty as you slowly make your way down.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Kristoff, 20-year-old farm hand and blacksmith who has left the safety of his exile in order to seek out this chalice and bring a cure to the disease plaguing his nation and his parents. Every challenge Kristoff overcomes will impact the story, as well as his interactions with others, who are all vying for the same prize in this hellish maze.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Multiple story paths and endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Multiple Party members and unique interactions for re-playability\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Engaging functions in turn-based combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Difficult bosses and enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3885530?t=1765281594","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3885530?t=1765281594","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885530/349a0968806ae8fdd860c86ebb2c583c7e3358c8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765281594","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885530/349a0968806ae8fdd860c86ebb2c583c7e3358c8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765281594","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"con